R">DISPOSITIF ET PROCEDE D'EMISSION/RECEPTION DE DONNEES</invention-title><citations><patent-citations><patcit ucid="JP-11025611-A"  status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>JP</country><doc-number>11025611</doc-number><kind>A</kind></document-id><sources><source category="AP" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit><patcit ucid="JP-11073730-A" status="new"><document-id status="new"  format="epo"><country>JP</country> <doc-number>11073730</doc-number><kind>A</kind></document-id><sources><source category="AP"  name="SEA"  created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit> <patcit ucid="JP-11110911-A" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>JP</country> <doc-number>11110911</doc-number> <kind>A</kind></document-id><sources><source category="AP" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit></patent-citations><non-patent-citations><nplcit status="new"><text>See also references of EP     1067543A1</text><sources><source name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></nplcit></non-patent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KONDO SATOSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MATSUSHITA ELECTRIC IND CO LTD</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MURAKI KENJI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KONDO, SATOSHI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MATSUSHITA ELECTRIC INDUSTRIAL CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MURAKI, KENJI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KONDO SATOSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MURAKI KENJI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KONDO, SATOSHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MURAKI, KENJI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A data transmitting/receiving device and method for reading/writing management information containing AV data and its annex data recorded on a recorded medium and synchronously reproducing contents when the management information is accessed by an external device. An audio list (201) comprises a pointer (222) to a title and a pointer (323) to text file information. The pointer (222) to a title describes information on the link of a title list (231) to a first object (233). The pointer (323) to the text file information describes information on the link of a second text file list (351) to the first object (353). With this list structure, access by an external device is easy.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un dispositif et un procédé d'émission/réception de données permettant la lecture/écriture d'informations de gestion contenant des données audiovisuelles ainsi que des données associées enregistrées sur un support d'enregistrement, et la reproduction synchronisée de leur contenu lorsqu'un périphérique accède à ces informations de gestion. Un liste (201) audio comprend un pointeur (222) désignant un titre et un pointeur (323) désignant des informations relatives à un fichier texte. Le pointeur (222) désignant un titre décrit des informations relatives au lien entre une liste (231) de titres et un premier objet (233). Le pointeur (323) désignant les informations relatives à un fichier texte décrit des informations relatives au lien entre une seconde liste (351) de fichiers texte et le premier objet (353). Cette structure de liste facilite l'accès du périphérique.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>